Hmm, but the task says "taking care with the mutex/locking used in each method". The roundRobinBalancer doesn't use a mutex in Next. Actually in upstream echo, the fix was:

```go
func (b *roundRobinBalancer) Next(c echo.Context) *ProxyTarget {
	b.mutex.RLock()
	defer b.mutex.RUnlock()
	if len(b.targets) == 0 {
		return nil
